#: src/backend/mod.rs:76
#, c-format
msgid "cannot reach backend: %s"
msgstr "ᱵᱮᱠᱮᱱᱰ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱥᱮᱴᱮᱨ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ: %s"

#: src/backend/mod.rs:79
#, c-format
msgid "handshake failed: %s"
msgstr "ᱦᱮᱱᱰᱥᱮᱠ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱥᱟᱹᱛ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ: %s"

#: src/backend/mod.rs:84
#, c-format
msgid "session rejected: %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "ᱫᱷᱚᱱ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ: %1$s: %2$s"

#: src/backend/mod.rs:91
#, c-format
msgid "malformed event from backend: %s"
msgstr "ᱵᱮᱠᱮᱱᱰ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱵᱟᱹᱲᱤᱡ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱤᱵᱷᱮᱱᱴ: %s"

#: src/backend/mod.rs:93
msgid "backend connection closed unexpectedly"
msgstr "ᱵᱮᱠᱮᱱᱰ ᱠᱟᱱᱮᱠᱥᱚᱱ ᱵᱤᱱ ᱟᱥᱟ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱵᱚᱱᱫᱚ ᱮᱱᱟ"

#: src/backend/mod.rs:95
#, c-format
msgid "transport error: %s"
msgstr "ᱥᱟᱜᱟᱲᱚᱢ ᱦᱩᱰᱟᱹᱜ: %s"

#: src/backend/share.rs:73
msgid ""
"no backend is connected - install one and connect it, e.g. `sudo snap "
"connect myna:backend myna-whisper`"
msgstr ""

#: src/backend/share.rs:80
#, c-format
msgid "%s is connected but offers no Unix socket"
msgstr "%s ᱡᱚᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱠᱷᱟᱱ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱠᱥ ᱥᱚᱠᱮᱴ ᱵᱟᱭ ᱮᱢᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ"

#: src/backend/share.rs:85
#, c-format
msgid "%s is connected but its server is not running"
msgstr "%s ᱡᱚᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱠᱷᱟᱱ ᱱᱚᱣᱟ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱥᱮᱨᱵᱷᱟᱨ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱪᱟᱹᱞᱩᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ"

#: src/backend/share.rs:91
#, c-format
msgid "connected shares with an unreadable provider.env: %s"
msgstr "ᱵᱟᱝ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱱ ᱯᱨᱚᱣᱟᱭᱤᱰᱟᱨ.ᱮᱱᱵᱷᱤ: : %s ᱥᱟᱶ ᱡᱚᱲᱟᱣ ᱥᱮᱭᱟᱨ"

#: src/backend/share.rs:101
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s backends are connected (%2$s); disconnect all but one (`snap "
"connections myna`)"
msgstr ""
"%1$s ᱵᱮᱠᱮᱱᱰ ᱠᱚ ᱡᱚᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ (%2$s); ᱢᱤᱫ ᱪᱷᱟᱰᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱠᱚ ᱡᱚᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱜᱮᱫ ᱢᱮ "
"(`snap connections myna`)"
